msgid "Controls the delay of animation between each element in a set. In seconds (0.0 - 5.0)."
msgstr "Bepaalt de animatievertraging tussen elk element in een set. In seconden (0.0 - 5.0)."

msgid "Controls the delay of animation between each element in a set. In seconds."
msgstr "Bepaalt de animatievertraging tussen elk element in een set. In seconden."

msgid "Controls the delay of rotation between each element in the set. In seconds."
msgstr "Bepaalt de rotatievertraging tussen elk element in de set. In seconden."

